Subject: [PATCH] Rephrase environment-constraint notes as plain documentation

Replaced 'this sandbox' framing throughout the README and phase-notes
with plain descriptions of the actual constraint (no GPU / no route to
huggingface.co on the machine used for a given pass). Same facts, written
as normal project documentation instead of narrating the execution
environment. Also fixed spacing in the README's repository-layout table.
